<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3696/01  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5155/62  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.6987/92  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2433/43  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.20/21   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1520/40  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1525.8/6.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     109.68/75  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6199/49  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4852/67  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8325/35  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4075/85  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7891/96  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7320/30  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5519/26</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$382.55/382.85</p>
